I have added smooth page-transition and in-page motions to `index.html`:
* **Page Switching Choreography:** Switching between **Cinema Details**, **Food & Snacks**, and **Reviews** now triggers a golden top progress sweep bar along with a smooth curtain crossfade and vertical glide.
* **In-Page Scroll Reveals & Hover Depth:** Sections smoothly reveal as you scroll down each page, hero premiere cards float gently, gallery and food images zoom smoothly on hover, and primary gold buttons have a subtle light-sheen sweep.
